{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>But they</b> — And behold, he did not mention the name of the informers and those who revealed his secret to Saul, but hinted with the word והמה to destruction, as in: תבואהו שואה (Psalms 35:8)." "<b>They shall be given over</b> — They shall be in the lower parts of the earth, like שואה ושפלה ממנה."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 63, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:36.433918778Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}